{"time_ns": 1789106597612422026, "kind": "result", "action_index": 16, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "ae42f0ead6af9474eda06fb2919e26dd66b8eb239b50a2116895fb1ba44bd770", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Status\n**COMPLETED** ✓\n\n## Executive Summary\nSuccessfully processed all 24 records and calculated regional totals for the ledger.\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n| Region | Total Amount (cents) | Record Count |\n|--------|----------------------|--------------|\n| North  | 513,325              | 8            |\n| South  | 393,763              | 8            |\n| West   | 476,948              | 8            |\n| **TOTAL** | **1,384,036**      | **24**       |\n\n## Records Processed\nAll records from R001 through R024 have been included in this analysis.\n\n**North Region Records:** R001, R004, R007, R010, R013, R016, R019, R022\n\n**South Region Records:** R002, R005, R008, R011, R014, R017, R020, R023\n\n**West Region Records:** R003, R006, R009, R012, R015, R018, R021, R024\n\n## Summary\nThe analysis covers all 24 regional transaction records with an aggregate total of $13,840.36 across three regions. The North region shows the highest total activity at $5,133.25, followed by the West region at $4,769.48, and the South region at $3,937.63.\n", "ok": true}
